// probeInterval is the cadence between info/refs probes during the clone
// wait. minReauthInterval floors how often we'll re-mint a repo-scoped
// token after a 401: STS rate-limits or auth flapping during a long wait
// shouldn't be amplified by the 2s probe cadence.
